### ── Diagnostics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check (shows Redis + analyzer status)
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### ── Authentication ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get a JWT (admin = editor + student roles)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=vault-admin

###

### Get a JWT (student role only)
POST http://localhost:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=student&password=vault-student

###

### ── Prompts (public) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all prompts (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8000/prompts

###

### List with pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/prompts?skip=0&limit=5

###

### Export all prompts as CSV
GET http://localhost:8000/prompts?format=csv

###

### Create a prompt (public — no auth needed)
POST http://localhost:8000/prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Explain recursion",
  "text": "Explain {concept} using a simple real-world analogy. Avoid jargon.",
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
  "category": "learning",
  "task_type": "explain concept",
  "effectiveness": 5,
  "tags": "teaching, recursion, analogy",
  "notes": "Works best when you name the concept explicitly.",
  "token_count": 95
}

###

### Get prompt by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/prompts/1

###

### Analyze a prompt with the LLM analyzer (public)
POST http://localhost:8000/prompts/1/analyze

###

### ── Prompts (editor role required) ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Update effectiveness and notes  [requires editor JWT]
PATCH http://localhost:8000/prompts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "effectiveness": 4,
  "notes": "Still good but sometimes over-explains."
}

###

### Refresh token count  [requires editor JWT + optional idempotency headers]
POST http://localhost:8000/prompts/1/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
X-Trace-Id: my-trace-001
Idempotency-Key: refresh:prompt:1:my-trace-001

###

### Delete a prompt  [requires editor JWT]
DELETE http://localhost:8000/prompts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

###

### ── Error cases ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 401 – missing token on a protected route
DELETE http://localhost:8000/prompts/1

###

### 422 – effectiveness out of range
POST http://localhost:8000/prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad prompt",
  "text": "Some text",
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "category": "coding",
  "task_type": "test",
  "effectiveness": 10
}
